<p class="lead">Hiring a staffing agency in Texas can cut weeks off your time-to-fill and lower the risk of a costly bad hire. Texas employers compete for workers in a fast-growing, crowded job market, and an experienced recruiting partner brings candidates, screening and market knowledge that most in-house teams don't have time to build. Here are the five biggest advantages, a side-by-side comparison, and a checklist for choosing the right agency.</p>

